ptr_of_wii
==========

will help use wiimote as a point and click device. eventually maybe more.

note
----
- if atleast 2 blobs exist, can take midpoint
- if atleast 1 blob exist, yk the prev pos of both blobs
  + estimate if the existing one is left or right blob
  + can get left or right by checking which prev blob state is curr close to
  + (estimation) then take the other blob as exisiting + distance b/w blobs
  + then take mid point, with visible and estimated blob
- if no dots are visible, hold the cursor

